  "post_install_note": "生成された cq.toml の roots / exclude を確認し、不要なディレクトリを除外してから\n`cq.ps1 index` / `./cq.sh index` を再実行してください。\nprofile を複数宣言した場合は `--profile <名>` または環境変数 CQ_PROFILE で選んでください。",
  "source_repo": "dahatake/RoyalytyService2ndGen",
  "source_commit": "9bf696e1",
  "local_patches": [
    "install.ps1 / install.py: force UTF-8 (stream and console code page) so Japanese output is readable on Windows",
    "cq.ps1: restore PYTHONPATH and the console encoding, and reach the documented exit code 2",
    "cq.ps1 / cq.sh / launch.py: correct the vendor-missing hint for a copied kit",
    "init_config.py: keep distribution kits and virtualenvs out of the generated profile",
    "vendor/cq/languages/python.py: a whitespace-only docstring no longer raises IndexError",
    "vendor/cq/indexer.py + vendor/cq/chunking.py: an unexpected parser or chunker error degrades one file instead of aborting the index, and is reported once",
    "vendor/cq/cli.py: a missing cq.toml is reported as such instead of looking for an upstream profile's database",
    "kit/kit_setup.py: a failing config scaffolder reports its own message instead of a traceback",
    "install.ps1: -Version / -Verify report the kit without bootstrapping a toolchain",
    "skill/SKILL.md: document the bundled launcher for repositories where `python -m cq` is not importable",
    "sync-vendor.ps1 / sync-vendor.sh: delegate to the bundled kit/kit_sync.py",
    "README.md / GETTING-STARTED.md / kit.toml: procedures, messages and links match this distribution layout"
  ],
